019	PSA	103	019	Yehova wakhazikitsa mpando wake waufumu mmwamba ndipo ufumu wake umalamulira onse.
019	PSA	103	020	Tamandani Yehova, inu angelo ake, amphamvu inu amene mumachita zimene amalamula, amene mumamvera mawu ake.
019	PSA	103	021	Tamandani Yehova, zolengedwa zonse zakumwamba, inu atumiki ake amene mumachita chifuniro chake.
019	PSA	103	022	Tamandani Yehova, ntchito yake yonse kulikonse mu ulamuliro wake. Tamanda Yehova, iwe moyo wanga.
019	PSA	104	001	Tamanda Yehova, iwe moyo wanga. Inu Yehova Mulungu wanga, ndinu wamkulu kwambiri; mwavala ulemerero ndi ufumu.
019	PSA	104	002	Iye wadzifunditsa kuwala ngati chovala; watambasula miyamba ngati tenti
019	PSA	104	003	ndipo wayika pa madzi mitanda ya chipinda chake. Iye amasandutsa mitambo kukhala galeta lake, ndi kuwuluka pa mapiko a mphepo.
019	PSA	104	004	Amapanga mphepo kukhala amithenga ake, malawi amoto kukhala atumiki ake.
019	PSA	104	005	Anakhazikitsa dziko lapansi pa maziko ake; silingasunthike.
019	PSA	104	006	Munaliphimba ndi nyanja yozama ngati chovala; madzi anayimirira pamwamba pa mapiri.
019	PSA	104	007	Koma pakudzudzula kwanu madzi anathawa, pa mkokomo wa bingu lanu iwo anamwazika;
019	PSA	104	008	Inu munamiza mapiri, iwo anatsikira ku zigwa kumalo kumene munawakonzera.
019	PSA	104	009	Inu munayika malire ndipo sangathe kudutsa, iwo sadzamizanso dziko lapansi.
019	PSA	104	010	Iye achititsa akasupe kutulutsa madzi kupita ku zigwa; madziwo amayenda pakati pa mapiri.
019	PSA	104	011	Iwo amapereka madzi kwa zirombo zonse zakuthengo; abulu akuthengo amapha ludzu lawo.
019	PSA	104	012	Mbalame zamlengalenga zimayika zisa mʼmbali mwa madzi; zimayimba pakati pa thambo.
019	PSA	104	013	Iye amathirira mapiri kuchokera ku zipinda zake zapamwamba; dziko lapansi limakhutitsidwa ndi chipatso cha ntchito yake.
019	PSA	104	014	Amameretsa udzu kuti ngʼombe zidye, ndi zomera, kuti munthu azilima kubweretsa chakudya kuchokera mʼdziko lapansi:
019	PSA	104	015	vinyo amene amasangalatsa mtima wa munthu, mafuta amene amachititsa nkhope yake kuwala, ndi buledi amene amapereka mphamvu.
019	PSA	104	016	Mitengo ya Yehova ndi yothiriridwa bwino, mikungudza ya ku Lebanoni imene Iye anadzala.
019	PSA	104	017	Mbalame zimamanga zisa zawo; kakowa ali ndi malo ake mʼmikungudzamo.
019	PSA	104	018	Mapiri ataliatali ndi a mbalale; mʼmingʼalu ya miyala ndi mobisalamo mbira.
019	PSA	104	019	Mwezi umasiyanitsa nyengo ndipo dzuwa limadziwa nthawi yake yolowera.
019	PSA	104	020	Inu mumabweretsa mdima nukhala usiku, ndipo zirombo zonse za ku nkhalango zimatuluka.
019	PSA	104	021	Mikango imabangula kufuna nyama, ndi kufunafuna chakudya chawo kuchokera kwa Mulungu.
019	PSA	104	022	Dzuwa limatuluka ndipo iyo imapita kukabisala; imabwerera kukagona pansi mʼmapanga awo.
019	PSA	104	023	Pamenepo munthu amapita ku ntchito yake, kukagwira ntchito yake mpaka madzulo.
019	PSA	104	024	Ntchito zanu ndi zochulukadi Inu Yehova! Munazipanga zonse mwanzeru, dziko lapansi ladzaza ndi zolengedwa zanu.
