041	MAR	013	016	Aliyense amene ali ku munda asabwerere kukatenga mkanjo wake.
041	MAR	013	017	Kudzakhala koopsa mʼmasiku amenewo kwa amayi oyembekezera ndi amayi oyamwitsa!
041	MAR	013	018	Pempherani kuti zimenezi zisadzachitike nthawi yozizira,
